{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "30cc834bfca9bbe7aefbf555c08c36be1fc02d6a56d4348ac35c2118204b6e43", "ja": "告知", "zh": "通知", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d6f9a12585f61e7062d9e95f5d518aff83bceadbf0d88bf41641d41698b1fbd8", "ja": "『765PRO ALLSTARS』全員が出演する\nオールスターライブの開催を喜ぶ春香たち。\n先輩たちのライブを待ち望む未来たちに\n美希は「最高のライブにできると思う」\nと、自信をもって言い切る。", "zh": "听闻将举办『765PRO ALLSTARS』所有成员\n一同演出的群星演唱会，春香等人非常雀跃。\n面对期待前辈演唱会的未来等人，\n美希自信满满地表示「一定能办出\n最棒的演唱会」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "9c682b24c7cc864fd9bb60bc1dce458ae365aafe9bee5eb1da384e68664d87d6", "ja": "オールスターライブ？", "zh": "群星演唱会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "9c682b24c7cc864fd9bb60bc1dce458ae365aafe9bee5eb1da384e68664d87d6", "ja": "オールスターライブ？", "zh": "群星演唱会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "9c682b24c7cc864fd9bb60bc1dce458ae365aafe9bee5eb1da384e68664d87d6", "ja": "オールスターライブ？", "zh": "群星演唱会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "f78c7ca8ea988290f1db76617be8d19b596d87102ef6c4f841087b7a6e82d1f8", "ja": "つまり……\n私たち13人のライブを、この劇場でするんですか？", "zh": "也就是说……\n要在这座剧场举办我们13个人的演唱会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d2c0d38cc1680d9b9dba593f4ca55ef4b320079934292a6e51495b6f1f4e4e7d", "ja": "そう、今までもゲストとか単発イベントとか、\n一部のメンバーでの公演には出てもらっていたけど……", "zh": "没错，之前你们当过来宾，办过单场活动，\n都是这类只有部分成员参与的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "57db6cbe5f7ddde46bce61a5a936101e76caea53b6bafa96cef11c89db5b6df2", "ja": "今回は『765PRO ALLSTARS』の正式な公演として\n色々な曲を、13人で歌ってもらうことになる。", "zh": "不过这次是『765PRO ALLSTARS』的正式公演，\n会让你们13个人演唱各式各样的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1db0a441b628e2dfebc3ddecab7e6dc24bbb684b5fd3abd06b7bb0e0d3cb2c5c", "ja": "公演用の新曲もあるから、楽しみにしていてくれよ！", "zh": "其中也有为公演制作的新歌，好好期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "2a8e09f1d2d89b2b33e3c318d511338161eaff69de1ac4060e46d7f9e7f55ca2", "ja": "わあ……♪　やったね千早ちゃん、美希！\n私たちの公演だって！", "zh": "哇……♪太好了，千早、美希！\n是我们的公演耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "d7a1c08c53294b537890b5392445603f653780338056a7fcafa381326722039e", "ja": "そうね……光栄です、{$P$}。\n劇場の主役を担う責任、しっかり果たしたいと。", "zh": "是啊……我很荣幸，{$P$}。\n我会期许自己能担起剧场主角的责任，好好表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "fcec45cc57af7881c84c52ed360cddd44265fc3a4b64557f39f88f92aef869e6", "ja": "ミキも、とってもうれしいってカンジ！\n劇場なら順番待ってる間、どこでも休めるし♪", "zh": "美希也很开心！\n办在剧场的话，等待出场的期间就有很多地方能休息了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c3ef4e2a5ade24d63005e5589ddc121bb9b9a267f04d08ceb9161c432493c067", "ja": "はは、休んでもいいけど寝ないでくれよ！\nとにかく……。", "zh": "哈哈，要休息是没问题，但可别睡着了！\n总之……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9931266ffc0af0eea0921915c597fdbfe3d0210d402dc1c568fe366b4751d123", "ja": "『765PRO ALLSTARS』の公演となると、劇場には\n今まで以上に、色々なお客さんが来てくれると思う。", "zh": "举办『765PRO ALLSTARS』的公演，\n一定会吸引比过去更多元的观众来到剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f25790a35c334ed51978fd8b4fbd173c7e39cbb59a3600c9bc35e9ac947abb5c", "ja": "みんなに最高の体験をしてもらうために……。\n今の全てを出し切って、最高の公演を目指してくれ！", "zh": "为了带给大家前所未有的体验……\n你们要发挥全力，目标是交出一场最精采的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "458b622b7be6c4cfab0152570a25ed7f10036eda926724e4f31afee4376c10d3", "ja": "はいなの！", "zh": "好唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "b7485efeb15d3313ab505ebf10d3a0c2fa66dbe7e47d5483970102973cd1bca7", "ja": "すっごーい、オールスターライブだって！\n私も楽しみにしてまーす！", "zh": "好棒～是群星演唱会耶！\n我也很期待喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "f2af1e83b0d4acf2729e0fe6444fe10ce297e15025401825c1ced4b30ee52056", "ja": "もう、未来ったら。\nそれじゃ普通のファンの人みたいじゃない。", "zh": "未来你也真是的，\n怎么表现得跟普通的粉丝一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c29f6bc701b167e8d4866b7177c8c231e85579d0b107b9f2912829be4068e4a7", "ja": "え～。静香ちゃん、春香さんたちのこと\n好きじゃないの？", "zh": "咦～小静，\n你不喜欢春香她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "ecc1761c39c7d4d77f9c1791c476af74353e41ef2f8606798ac84a52783f4b6d", "ja": "そんなこと言ってないでしょっ！\nす……好きに、決まってるじゃない。もう。", "zh": "我没有这样说吧！？\n我……我当然喜欢呀，真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "3c9a6cbf5bcb4a90a533ae42930bc26b4f92d7ff743fa57e5ad3c345267cb60a", "ja": "あはっ、3人とも聞いてたんだね。ありがとう♪\nうん、私たち頑張るから、楽しみにしててね！", "zh": "啊哈，原来你们三个也听到了，谢谢♪\n嗯，我们会加油的，好好期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "e59efbac0b76426738abc72d41409b38e8bc4e93d3c262dd7319d4e561127f23", "ja": "はいっ、劇場のみんなで応援に来ます！\nいいですよね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "好的，剧场的大家会一起来帮你们加油的！\n可以吧，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f78aba88069ea79357b2f4d66381dd2317b6ff14921ca82a508394bc34866d8a", "ja": "いいけど……関係者席には限りがあるからな。\n39人全員座れるとは限らないぞ？", "zh": "可以是可以……但招待席的座位有限，\n不保证39人都能入座喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "df9ef51f604ea039b6d2fcdd77dcf38edef821b8a444fe0e959753b3968e4bf2", "ja": "大丈夫でーす♪\n足りない時はジャンケンで決めますね！", "zh": "没问题～♪\n要是座位不够我们会用猜拳决定的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "46644e19b48916ee8628ebf5d0421e3d2128f660e203d6139d5ad4e0c7712fb5", "ja": "え～っ、そんなのずるいよ～！\n私、翼に勝ったことないのに～。", "zh": "咦～好奸诈喔～！\n我猜拳从没赢过翼耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "5486dddf99e6513e419717aec90a7292a6fb001b54d1d894c775dd461c40b805", "ja": "別に、舞台袖からでもいいですけど……。\nできるだけお願いします、{$P$}。", "zh": "我们在舞台侧边看也没关系……\n万事拜托了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "36196c93381ca739e48ac6788dfee37a70156862f80bd675da3e4f2696f33ebf", "ja": "わ、わかった。まあ、どうせ観るなら、\n客席からの方が参考になるかもしれないな。", "zh": "我、我知道了，不过既然要看，\n那在观众席看会更有参考价值吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "f28c935e3ee5160a4f580e862bf46f18b0817738e6ab609de38706e62e9996e2", "ja": "参考になるに決まってるじゃないですか！\n尊敬する先輩方のライブなんですから。", "zh": "当然有参考价值呀！\n那可是我们尊敬的前辈们的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "dc24154693f75fb83256b617b3893a0394f4d849dbfcfba9ac911ff93c326426", "ja": "でも、そんな風に身構えられると……。\nできれば、普通に楽しんでもらえた方が……。", "zh": "但你们说得这么郑重，就有点……\n可以的话，还是希望你们用平常心来欣赏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "6b85ffc5f3c71e23a2852df7508a9081ae05cb69a1828423aac3a0e569f4cc29", "ja": "そうそう。それに先輩って言っても、もう私たちが\nみんなから勉強させてもらうことも多いんだよ？", "zh": "没错没错，而且你们刚刚说我们是前辈，\n但其实我们也从你们身上学到了不少呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "aaa7cd61d50f1bab18c7551e7c9f409beef8d8a4822a21ee7c9d52b6938ab25a", "ja": "そ、そんな！　私たちなんて、\n春香さんたちに比べたらまだまだで……。", "zh": "怎、怎么会！\n跟春香你们比起来，我们还差太远了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "143986bbcc466109a52cbfbdb253652e6f4af52ee45c12e0a83acf703173160c", "ja": "ありがとうございまーす！\nほらね静香ちゃん、やっぱり楽しんでいいんだって！", "zh": "谢谢啰～！\n好啦小静，还是轻松欣赏就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "b6ef3543b35b4ded2ce8e6a493bba203d646534862e30b23500b1103e9896a8c", "ja": "も～、未来はすぐ調子に乗らないの！", "zh": "未来你啊～别一下就得意忘形！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "da1240743d657dce25f6aa09f1af99426b4acbb875dc423f85dd23e952b76604", "ja": "あはは、ふたりともおもしろーい♪", "zh": "啊哈哈，你们两个真有趣～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "ad350370f407ff340b08efe7b8f26128a8872a916b791f09f9751681d8f358e7", "ja": "ん～。\nミキは、静香の言うとおりかもって思うな。", "zh": "嗯～\n但美希觉得静香说的应该没错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1036_002chi", "source_sha256": "9b52246a7bc999ef09a75aa159ca6fa4955bff98a53cfcf78e36d27d4c49e859", "ja": "美希……？", "zh": "美希……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "2ae4fe096125631c8b299dd6a6075c1faead6e69160ab9cf72c8620b0993b8a1", "ja": "春香と千早さん。貴音と響とでこちゃんとー、\n真くん、雪歩、あずさとやよい……。", "zh": "这是有春香、千早、贵音、响、额头妹，\n还有阿真、雪步、梓、弥生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "3331fde3140f17bd35c0131ae16d044c72d1cbae37e11023089dcf016c1fa058", "ja": "亜美と真美と、律子、さん。\nそれとミキとで、いっぱいライブするんでしょ？", "zh": "亚美、真美和律子……姊再加上美希，\n所有人大集合的演唱会对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1039_003mik", "source_sha256": "4113533594413f9e04c238953542d8781069cc6f68a55b5c0348ce9dc03102ae", "ja": "なら大丈夫なの。ちゃんと最高のライブにできるって\n思うから、サンコーとかにしていいよ♪", "zh": "那一定没问题唷，\n美希觉得一定能成为最棒的演唱会，尽管拿来参考吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "25be76b8c9ffce3b15b046a3ea1187c8b40e119d556a5e9a218760d6fa1ba5b6", "ja": "わぁ……！", "zh": "哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "e4da1f2afd9b692315bf9128f569c008609b3a2b5e18438fd9088f04ee12f0eb", "ja": "あはは、美希らしいな～。\nでも……、そうかもしれないね。", "zh": "哈哈，真有美希的风格～\n但……也许真的是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "02d3dcd9f45373ed23fd147ab12f9c14bb8974262f915f8d633cef1cf045ff65", "ja": "ええ。さっそく準備を進めて……。\nオールスターライブ、必ず成功させましょう。", "zh": "没错，要赶紧开始准备……\n我们一定要让群星演唱会成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1043_001har", "source_sha256": "7054e9b66005d311ef12dfaa56dd970f3fdb6212af4efcdfe95933e77552f7e1", "ja": "うん♪　今までやって来たことを信じて……。\n最高の私たちで、最高のライブを目指します♪", "zh": "嗯♪要相信我们一路累积的经验……\n由最棒的我们，带来最棒的演唱会♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "0ae326952f93f7048c52a89a25763db03c753c7f73cb314a56a45009e650453b", "ja": "（春香たちのモチベーションは高い。\n美希の言う通り最高のライブを目指せるだろう）", "zh": "（春香她们的士气高昂，\n如同美希说的，应该能以最棒的演唱会为目标吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "2a3c50f5225941fbcff5f870d9b27ff52d38046a953ba980d01d1d43f28deb7f", "ja": "（俺は、みんなが目標に向かって進めていけるように\n公演の準備を滞りなく進めていこう！）", "zh": "（我要加紧节奏为公演做准备，\n协助大家朝目标前进！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
